  "_comment": "The excerpt of the text around the cursor that goes to the clean-up (CursorContext), shared by the macOS and Windows tests so both apps send the same. A case gives either before/selected/after (with cut: the parts read only up to a length, whose cut end may be anywhere, even inside a character), or text with a selection in UTF-16 offsets ([location, length], null when the field doesn't say). expect null: nothing is sent.",
